  "title": "GlowMiner",
  "description": "Makes ores glow, no shaders required. This texture pack adds emissive features to create visible glowing ores.",
  "body": "<center>\n<img src=\"https://imgur.com/1Gmm9Tl.png\" alt=\"GlowMiner\" width=\"400\">\n<img src=\"https://imgur.com/6FCY0L8.png\" alt=\"screenshot\">\n</center>\n\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\n### &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [Continuity](https://modrinth.com/mod/continuity) mod required. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n\n</center>\n<br>\n<bR>\n\nThe GlowMiner resource pack brings glowing ores to Vanilla minecraft, no shaders required. Only adds emissive properties to ore blocks which only makes the color of them glow for improved visibility.\n\n- Adds a subtle glow effect to ores\n- Shaders not required.\n- May use with shaders missing glowing ores.\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://imgur.com/BHxembc.png\" alt=\"glowing blocks\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\nIdeal for survival players who want a whimsical caveing experience and faster ore spotting while keeping the authentic Minecraft feel.\n\n<br>\n\n<center>✅ No outlines &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ✅ No animations &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ✅ No retexturing\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n",
